Primvars on the render settings prim are translated as user data on the options

primvars:disable_smart_opaque is authored on the render settings, so the
transparent sphere must render opaque (solid red) since its opaque attribute is
left on. Without the user data, the green backdrop shows through the sphere.

It works only in hydra2 mode with the render settings prim.

author: sebastien.blaineau.ortega@autodesk.com

PARAMS: {'scene':'test.usda'}
